1. DATASET PROVENANCE & ATTRIBUTION:
   - Dataset Title: Student Performance Dataset
   - Original Authors: Paulo Cortez and Alice Silva (University of Minho, Portugal)
   - Official UCI Machine Learning Repository:
     https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/320/student+performance
   - Secondary Kaggle Mirror:
     https://www.kaggle.com/dskagglemt/student-performance-data-set/metadata
   - Citation:
     Cortez, P., & Silva, A. (2008). Using Data Mining to Predict Secondary
     School Student Performance. In A. Brito & J. Teixeira (Eds.), Proceedings
     of 5th FUture BUsiness TEChnology Conference (FUBUTEC 2008), pp. 5-12,
     Porto, Portugal, EUROSIS, ISBN 978-9077381-39-7.
   - License Terms of Dataset: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
     (CC BY 4.0). The dataset is used here strictly for academic, research,
     and open-source educational demonstration purposes.

